File Index

/AccessibilitySettingsModal.tsx
Purpose: Provides a modal interface for users to adjust accessibility settings like font scale and high contrast preferences.

/AffectsBlock.tsx
Purpose: Displays and manages game affect states with time, aggregates, and plugin integration.

/AudioSettingsModal.tsx
Purpose: Audio settings modal component for managing beep sounds and audio preferences.

/AutoLevelingModal.tsx
Purpose: Provides a configuration UI for the autoleveling system with persisted settings and map data loading.

/BottomPane.tsx
Purpose: Bottom pane component managing mobile UI tabs for compass, chat, and opponent views.

/ChatPane.tsx
Purpose: Chat pane component for displaying and managing real-time chat messages with subtype filtering and settings.

/CommandInput.tsx
Purpose: Interactive command input component with voice dictation and auto-leveling controls for game automation.

/CompassBlock.tsx
Purpose: Interactive 3D compass UI component for directional navigation and movement.

/CompassBlockMobile.tsx
Purpose: Mobile compass interface for directional navigation in the game client.

/ConnectModal.tsx
Purpose: Connects users to MUD servers with saved connection management.

/ContributeCreatureLoreModal.tsx
Purpose: Modal component for contributing creature lore and appearance details.

/ContributeIdentifyModal.tsx
Purpose: Displays a modal for users to contribute and identify game content.

/EquipmentHotbar.tsx
Purpose: Displays and manages equipment slots for player characters in the game interface.

/EquipmentModal.tsx
Purpose: Displays and manages a player's equipment state with hotbar docking options.

/FocusBarVitals.tsx
Purpose: Displays player vitals and focus bar with damage chunks for HP, MP, and stamina.

/GraphicsSettingsModal.tsx
Purpose: Provides a modal interface for users to customize and save graphics settings with persistence.

/LayoutShell.tsx
Purpose: Provides main application layout structure with resizable panes and integrated terminal interface.

/LibraryModal.tsx
Purpose: Provides a modal interface for managing game library content including parchments, notes, books, and color previews.

/MainMenuBar.tsx
Purpose: Provides main application menu bar with file, game, plugins, and contribute options.

/MiscPane.tsx
Purpose: This file implements the miscellaneous settings pane with bestiary, archives, autopilot, and log sections.

/PluginConfigEditor.tsx
Purpose: Plugin configuration editor component with live updates and validation.

/PluginConfigModal.tsx
Purpose: Plugin configuration modal component for managing plugin settings and user preferences.

/PluginsModal.tsx
Purpose: Displays a modal for managing core plugins including installation, configuration, and enabling/disabling them.

/PluginsPage.tsx
Purpose: Displays and manages plugin enablement and configuration for a game client connection.

/RightSidebar.tsx
Purpose: Displays and manages the right sidebar UI including status blocks, enemy info, and HUD toggles.

/RoomHeader.tsx
Purpose: React component displaying room name and flags in a game client interface.

/ScriptingHelpModal.tsx
Purpose: Provides interactive scripting help documentation with draggable modal and section navigation.

/Terminal.tsx
Purpose: Interactive terminal component with touch scrolling and inertia support.

/UserScriptSandboxModal.tsx
Purpose: A React component for managing user script sandboxes with import/export functionality.

/UserStyleOverrideModal.tsx
Purpose: Provides a modal interface for users to edit and apply custom CSS overrides.
